---

<section id="about_me">
  <h3 class="title-section">Sobre mí</h3>
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="image-wrapper">
      <div class="image-frame">
        <img src="perfil.jpeg" alt="Perfil" class="profile-image" />
      </div>
      <div class="decoration-circle"></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <p class="intro-text">
        Soy estudiante de <strong>Ingeniería Civil en Computación</strong> apasionado por crear soluciones innovadoras a través del desarrollo web y móvil.
      </p>
      
      <div class="experience-block">
        <h4 class="block-title">🚀 Experiencia Destacada</h4>
        <p>
          En <strong>Alara</strong>, una startup enfocada en seguridad innovadora, desarrollé una aplicación móvil con <strong>Flutter</strong>, combinando perspectivas técnicas y de seguridad en un proyecto desafiante.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-summary">
        <h4 class="block-title">💡 Áreas de Expertise</h4>
        <div class="expertise-tags">
          <span class="tag">Web Development</span>
          <span class="tag">Mobile Apps</span>
          <span class="tag">Machine Learning</span>
          <span class="tag">Ciberseguridad</span>
          <span class="tag">Análisis de Riesgos</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="closing-text">
        Siempre en busca de nuevos desafíos y tecnologías que impulsen mi crecimiento como desarrollador.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about_me {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 80px 20px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .title-section {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .about-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .image-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .decoration-circle {
    position: absolute;
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), transparent);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translateY(0px);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translateY(-20px);
    }
  }

  .image-frame {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05));
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .image-frame:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .profile-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .intro-text {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .experience-block,
  .skills-summary {
    padding: 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .experience-block:hover,
  .skills-summary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-left-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .block-title {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .experience-block p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .expertise-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .tag:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .closing-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 10px 0 0 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .title-section {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .decoration-circle {
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
    }

    .image-frame {
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
    }

    .expertise-tags {
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .tag {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      padding: 6px 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
